Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Every chargeback story ends the same way: the\Nmoney already left. Disputes, evidence,\Npenalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,GeoShield Pay moves the decision earlier —\Nbefore PayPal even creates an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real checkout. The browser sends\Ndevice GPS, the server resolves the request\NIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Both land in the same Californian metro.\NVerdict: pass, risk score zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Same store, same cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But this IP is a Tor exit node in Germany\Nwhile the phone sits in New York —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,over six thousand kilometres apart, on a proxy\Nnetwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard-blocked before a PayPal order exists.\NNothing to dispute, because nothing was\Ncharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not every fraud is that loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The geography looks clean here, but the PayPal\Naccount and billing country are China,\Nshipping to the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead of capturing, GeoShield authorizes\Nthe payment and parks the funds for\Nseventy-two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every interception you just watched is already\Nin the merchant console —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that blocked order is the one we created\Nseconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Funds in the buffer cabin keep their live\Ncountdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing was captured, so no dispute can open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the buffered order: IP versus GPS, the\Ndistance, the three countries, the\Ninterception timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the AI analyst reads the signal chain and\Nwrites the story in plain English.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a live model call, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the rules. The merchant blacklists\None country and saves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Under a second later the engine already runs\Nthe new rule — no restart, no deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Blocked before the money moves: that is the\Nproduct.
